# Docker only reads .dockerignore from the exact build context root — this is
# that root when building kyc-frontend-21's Dockerfile with context set to
# frontendApplications/ (needed so it can reach the sibling frontend-libs-21).
# Applies to every project folder here, not just the two involved in that build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.git
